    lowest resulting KVPR, models sorted by req_rate/slo desc), then anneal:
    propose random single-model moves or pairwise swaps, accept improving
    moves always and worsening moves with probability exp(-delta/T) under an
    exponential cooling schedule. Feasibility (memory) enforced by rejecting
    infeasible proposals. Returns the best placement found."""
